@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - UML State Machine Diagram

state StartChoice <<choice>>
state LoggedOut
state LoggedIn
state Applying
state Paid
state Approved
state Rejected
state ViewingStatus
state CheckingStatus
state Cancelling
state ModifyingDetails
state ViewingDetails
state GivingFeedback
state LoggingOut

StartChoice -->|Create Account| LoggedOut:User
LoggedOut -->|Login| LoggedIn:User
LoggedIn -->|Apply for Visa and Pay| Applying
Applying -->|Accepted| Paid:User
Paid -->|Approved| Approved:User
Paid -->|Rejected| Rejected:User
Rejected -->|View Status| ViewingStatus:User
ViewingStatus -->|Check Status| CheckingStatus:User
CheckingStatus -->|Update Status| ViewingStatus:User
ViewingStatus -->|Cancel Application| Cancelling:User
Cancelling -->|Modify Details| ModifyingDetails:User
ModifyingDetails -->|Give Feedback| GivingFeedback:User
GivingFeedback -->|Log Out| LoggingOut:User
@enduml
